% SimpleInput 範例：基本刷法
M:4/4
L:1/8
Q:1/4=82
K:F#m
T:0

% @basic  =  x2!f d:123!mf u:321!mp d:123!mp u:321!p
% @basic = t 3 2 3 1 3 2 3
@basic = t 1 2 1 3 1 2 1
@one=t 1
@two=t 1 2 1 
@three= t 3 2 3 1 3
@strum= x2~64!mf d!mf u2!mp u!mp d!mf u!mp
@s2=x2 d u
@s3=x2 d u x2 
@trans=t 1 2 1 3 1 x2

@end = x2 d:123 u:321
@f4 = d d d d d d d d
@island = d2 u d u d2 u
@arp    = t (23) 1 (23) 1 (23) 1 (23)

z2 | F#m(4) @basic | D(4) @basic | E(4) @basic | A(3) @three C#(1) @one| 
F#m(4) @basic| D(4) @basic | E(4) @basic| F#m(4) @basic|
F#m(4) @basic | D(4) @basic | E(4) @basic| A(2) @two C#(2) @two |
F#m(4) @basic| Bm(4) @basic| D(2) @two E(2) @two | F#m(4)  @trans  |
A(4) @strum | E(4)  @strum | D(4)  @strum | A(4)  @strum |
Bm(4)  @strum |C#m(4) @strum  | D(4) @strum  | E(4)  @strum |
A(4)  @strum | E(4)  @strum | D(4) @strum  | A(4)  @strum |
Bm(2) @s2 C#m(2) @s2 | D(2) @s2 E(2) @s2 | D(2) @s2 E(2) @s2|F#m(3) @s3 |
